  "notes": "Shipped enabled by default in Chrome 148 across desktop, Android, and WebView. linear_indexing is a WGSL language extension: available automatically when listed in navigator.gpu.wgslLanguageFeatures; a requires-directive is optional and only documents the dependency. BCD tracks it as api.WGSLLanguageFeatures.extension_linear_indexing (Chrome 148; Firefox/Safari false); webstatus.dev has no separate entry (parent webgpu = limited). Errors (2026-11-15): requires on an unsupported implementation is a shader-creation error; u32 overflow of either value fails the dispatch."
